WEBVTT

00:08:28.796 --> 00:08:30.716
it's a necessity and a right.

00:08:31.396 --> 00:08:35.556
Just like hopes, dreams and opportunity.

00:08:36.076 --> 00:08:38.716
Shining a way forward for each of us

00:08:38.756 --> 00:08:41.996
and, in turn, allowing us to make
the world better for others.

00:08:42.676 --> 00:08:46.396
I am Makhtoum Abdalla from Otash IDP camp,

00:08:46.436 --> 00:08:48.556
but I am so much more than that.

00:08:49.716 --> 00:08:50.956
I say it proudly.

00:08:50.996 --> 00:08:52.516
With the power of education,

00:08:52.556 --> 00:08:54.876
I can make the world a better place.

00:08:55.196 --> 00:08:56.356
We all can.

00:08:56.356 --> 00:08:57.516
Thank you.